  "body": "Modern comfort · coastal charm · everyday ease\r\n\r\nWelcome to 35 Mahinga Kai Road, Orewa — a brand-new home where modern design meets relaxed coastal living. Featuring quality finishes and a practical layout, this home offers comfort and convenience with minimal upkeep. Enjoy easy access to Orewa Beach, local cafés and everyday amenities, all within a popular coastal community.\r\n\r\n• Schools & education\r\nConveniently located near local schooling options, including Nukumea Primary School, Orewa Primary School and Orewa College — all within approximately a 5-minute drive. With educational facilities nearby, this location offers added convenience for families looking to settle in the beautiful Orewa community.\r\n\r\n• Single-level living\r\nThoughtfully designed on one level, this home offers effortless living with three well-appointed bedrooms, including a private master suite with its own ensuite, complemented by a second bathroom. Set on a 187sqm section, with a floor area of approximately 100sqm, the home also features a single internal-access garage with an integrated laundry area for added convenience.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully appointed open-plan kitchen features elegant cabinetry and premium Bosch appliances, creating a stylish and functional heart of the home. The kitchen, dining and living areas flow seamlessly outdoors to a lovely rear deck — perfect for summer BBQs, soaking up the sunshine or simply unwinding in your own private space.\r\n\r\nEnjoy year-round comfort with Mitsubishi Heavy Industries central air conditioning, ensuring a pleasant indoor environment in every season. Combining contemporary design, quality finishes and a practical layout, this home brings comfort, style and easy living together.\r\n\r\n• Features & highlights\r\nMaster Build 10-Year Guarantee for added peace of mind;\r\nPremium Bosch dishwasher and oven for quality and convenience;\r\nMitsubishi Heavy Industries central air conditioning for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\n• A lifestyle you'll love\r\nJust a short drive from Orewa Beach, local cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities, this home offers a wonderful balance of coastal relaxation and everyday convenience. Enjoy morning beach walks, coffee at your favourite café and quality time with family, all within easy reach of home.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your first home, a comfortable place for your family or a smart property investment, this brand-new home at 35 Mahinga Kai Road offers a great opportunity to enjoy modern living in one of Auckland's popular coastal communities.\r\n\r\nA place to feel at home. A lifestyle to love.",
